{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48784","headline":"奉和守岁应制 · 许敬宗","name":"奉和守岁应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉琯移玄序，金奏赏彤闱。\n祥鸾歌里转，春燕舞前归。\n寿爵传三礼，灯枝丽九微。\n运广薰风积，恩深湛露曦。\n送寒终此夜，延宴待晨晖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48784.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48784","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}